OL,3,AAttacks victim's death 'potentially
OL,4,Apreventable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a student killed in the
OL,7,FNottingham attacks was "potentially
OL,8,Fpreventable", an inquiry has heard.
OL,10,FBarnaby Webber - along with Grace
OL,11,FO'Malley-Kumar and Ian Coates - were
OL,12,Fkilled by Valdo Calocane, who had been
OL,13,Fdiagnosed with paranoid schizophrenia
OL,14,Fin 2020, in June 2023.
OL,16,FOn Tuesday, ahead of closing statements
OL,17,Fto the Nottingham Inquiry, the hearing
OL,18,Fwas told a "more rapid administration
OL,19,Fof blood products" could have increased
OL,20,FBarnaby's chances of getting to
OL,21,Fhospital with enough of a heartbeat to
OL,22,Fundergo surgery.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
